        "original_id": "7f6682ab-696d-5f53-8bb5-f6d97f4fe665",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kodi Smit-McPhee, Geoffrey Simpson, Eric Bana, Franka Potente\n- Films: The Road, Let Me In, ParaNorman, Dawn of the Planet of the Apes, Romulus, My Father\n- Roles: The Boy, Owen, Norman Babcock, Alexander, Nightcrawler\n\nFacts:\n- A film adaptation of Romulus, My Father was released in 2007 and starred Eric Bana, Franka Potente, and Kodi Smit-McPhee.\n- Geoffrey Simpson received critical praise for his work on Shine, Oscar and Lucinda (1997), and Romulus, My Father (2007).\n- Kodi Smit-McPhee is best known for playing The Boy in The Road, Owen in Let Me In, Norman Babcock in ParaNorman, Alexander in Dawn of the Planet of the Apes, and Nightcrawler in a 2016 film.\n- ParaNorman mainly received positive reviews and was a modest box office success, earning $107 million against a $60 million budget.",
